Z||000000||FieroRyan||10-01-2001||03:16 AM||||This is what I want to do to my stock 1986 2m4:<P>1.  Add side scoops<BR>2.  Notchback-to-Fastback Conversion<BR>3.  Change to Aeronose<BR>4.  Add rocker panels<P>Has anyone else done this?  How hard would this be to do, especially #2-4?  Would changing the nose need more things done to the body?<P>Also, anyone know where I could get an aeronose?  I know of a custom one for $460, but I want one cheaper...<P><BR>Thanks!<P><BR>P.S.  Sorry if some of this doesn't make sense, it's late.||||reg||1
