Z||000002||FieroBUZZ||10-01-2001||06:52 AM||||Your best bet would be to find a thrashed donor car as you want most of the body panels anyway.  The change over is just time consuming.  Remember there are differences in fender liners, bumper honeycomb and mounts, etc.  The biggie is that your coupe has ribbed trim and the GT clip will have rounded.  An SE aero nose will be ribbed as well.<BR>Good Luck!<BR>Gary||||reg||12
